 RAD  * ============================================================= *
 RAD  *   Generic header of list APIs                                 *
 RAD  * ============================================================= *
 RAD  *   >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                            *
 RAD  *                                                               *
 RAD  *     >>CRTCMD<<  CRTPF         FILE(&LI/&OB) +                 *
 RAD  *                               SRCFILE(&SL/&SF)  +             *
 RAD  *                               SRCMBR(&SM);                    *
 RAD  *                                                               *
 RAD  *     >>COMPILE<<                                               *
 RAD  *       >>PARM<<                MAXMBRS(1);                     *
 RAD  *       >>PARM<<                MBR(*FILE);                     *
 RAD  *       >>PARM<<                FILETYPE(*DATA);                *
 RAD  *     >>END-COMPILE<<                                           *
 RAD  *                                                               *
 RAD  *     >>EXECUTE<<                                               *
 RAD  *                                                               *
 RAD  *   >>END-PRE-COMPILER<<                                        *
 RAD  *===============================================================*
 RAD  *                                                               *
 RAD A          R GENDTASTRC                TEXT('Generic header of list APIs')
      *
     A            USERAREA      64A         TEXT('64-Byte User Area           ')
     A            SIZEGENHDR     9B 0       TEXT('Size of generic header      ')
     A            STRUCREL       4A         TEXT('Structure''s release and +
     A                                            level')
     A            FORMAT         8A         TEXT('Format name                 ')
     A            APIUSED       10A         TEXT('API used                    ')
     A            CRTDATE       13A         TEXT('Date and time created       ')
     A            INFSTAT        1A         TEXT('Information status          ')
     A            SPCSIZE        9B 0       TEXT('Size of user space used     ')
     A            OFSINPSCT      9B 0       TEXT('Offset to input +
     A                                            parameter section')
     A            SIZEINPSCT     9B 0       TEXT('Size of input parameter +
     A                                            section')
     A            OFSHDRSCT      9B 0       TEXT('Offset to header section    ')
     A            SIZEHDRSCT     9B 0       TEXT('Size of header section      ')
     A            OFSLSTSCT      9B 0       TEXT('Offset to list data section ')
     A            SIZELSTSCT     9B 0       TEXT('Size of list data section   ')
     A            NBRENTRIES     9B 0       TEXT('Number of list entries      ')
     A            SIZEENTRY      9B 0       TEXT('Size of each entry          ')
     A            CCSIDLST       9B 0       TEXT('CCSID of data in the +
     A                                            list entries')
     A            CNTRYID        2A         TEXT('Country ID                  ')
     A            LNGID          3A         TEXT('Language ID                 ')
     A            SUBLSTIND      1A         TEXT('Subsetted list indicator    ')
     A            RES_01        42A         TEXT('Reserved                    ')
      *  Zusätzliche Felder für Format 0300
     A            APIENTPN     256A         TEXT('API entry point name        ')
     A            RES_02       128A         TEXT('Reserved                    ')
      *
